WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.501
Today we

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:01.935
are making

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.937
Roti or Paratha

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:05.505
Some countries

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:06.506
call it roti

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.474
while others

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.742
call it paratha

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:09.242
For this

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:09.542
we need

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:10.143
all purpose

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.077
flour,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.679
salt, sugar,

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.147
lukewarm water

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.648
and oil

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:16.282
Let's start

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:16.750
by making

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.550
the dough

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.118
Grab some

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:18.685
all purpose

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:19.285
flour,

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:20.220
half a teaspoon

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.388
of sugar

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.088
and just

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:22.822
under half a

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:23.289
teaspoon

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:24.591
of salt

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.025
Mix it

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:25.592
all together

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.594
nicely

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:30.563
Use lukewarm

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:30.897
water

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:31.531
and add it

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:31.831
little

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:32.399
by little,

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:33.199
just as much

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.201
as you need

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.150
Once the dough

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.751
nearly done,

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:52.185
add a

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:52.652
teaspoon

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.654
of oil

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:00.960
Our dough

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.962
is ready now

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.097
I'm using a

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:04.831
pastry mat

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:05.331
Sprinkle

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:05.765
some flour

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.767
on it

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:08.168
Divide

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:08.701
the dough

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:09.469
into smaller

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:11.471
balls

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:23.683
Roll the dough

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:24.717
into rotis

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:25.318
as thin

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:26.886
as possible

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:27.187
Brush

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:27.687
some oil

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:28.388
on top

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:29.222
You can use

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:29.923
any oil

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:30.857
of your choice,

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:31.758
or even butter

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.226
if you like

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.094
A little

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:34.627
more flour

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:40.467
Just roll

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.234
it like this

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.236
As shown

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:46.606
Now I'll

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.273
roll it up

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.041
like a cinnamon

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:50.043
roll

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:56.950
Add a little

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.952
oil on top

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:01.955
Cover it

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:02.789
and let it rest

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:03.223
for half

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:04.791
an hour

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.792
I let it rest

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.392
for 30

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.394
to 35 minutes

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:12.432
Now we'll make

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:14.434
the rotis

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.781
Roll the rotis

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:29.315
as thin

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:31.317
as possible

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:38.725
Ensure

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:39.592
the pan is nice

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:40.360
and hot

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:40.727
Before

00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:42.729
you start

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.798
Cook both sides

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:46.332
and add

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.033
a little oil

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.035
while cooking

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.552
It's ready now

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:06.619
This roti is

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:07.587
very soft

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:08.388
You can enjoy it

00:03:08.388 --> 00:03:10.089
with any curry

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:10.723
or use

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:11.491
it as a roll

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:12.825
or wrap

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:13.459
Enjoy

